--   * Elementary students are unique to one teacher/class.
--   * Middle/high students are cross-scheduled across subject teachers.
--   * District Administrator Riley Patel is assigned to all three schools.
-- NOTE: The current schema has no separate intervention catalog table. The 8
-- intervention records below are seeded as reusable demo interventions and are
-- assigned to saved instructional groups using intervention_assignments.

